    <briefdescription>
<para>A struct of argument access info. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;Unknown&quot; accesses are the cases like unrecognized instructions, instructions that have more than one use of the argument, or volatile memory accesses. &quot;WriteWithSideEffect&quot; are call instructions that not only write an argument but also capture it. </para>
